---
import BlogLayout from "../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";

const title = "Pakistan Income Tax Guide: FBR Tax Slabs, Rates & Calculator";
const description = "Complete Pakistan income tax guide. Learn FBR tax slabs for salaried individuals, tax-free limit, allowable deductions, and calculate your income tax in Pakistan.";
const image = "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562564055-71e051d33c19?w=1200&q=80";
const canonical = "https://finsiva.com/blogs/pakistan-income-tax-guide";
const author = "Ayesha Malik";
const authorBio = "Chartered accountant specializing in Pakistani income tax compliance and financial planning.";
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
const readTime = "10 min read";

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the tax-free limit for salaried individuals in Pakistan?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The tax-free limit for salaried individuals in Pakistan is PKR 600,000 annually. Any income below this threshold is taxed at 0%."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is income tax calculated on salary in Pakistan?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Income tax is calculated by taking gross annual salary, subtracting exempt allowances (such as medical allowance up to 10% of basic salary) and allowable deductions, then applying progressive FBR slab rates."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the penalty for non-filing tax returns in Pakistan?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Non-filers face significantly higher withholding tax rates on banking transactions, vehicle purchases, property transfers, and cash withdrawals under FBR Active Taxpayer List (ATL) rules."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---

<BlogLayout title={title} description={description} image={image} canonical={canonical} author={author} authorBio={authorBio} lastUpdated={lastUpdated} readTime={readTime}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <main class="min-h-screen">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6 text-sm">
          <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Home</a></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-muted" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/blogs" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Blogs</a></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-muted" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span class="font-medium text-ink dark:text-on-primary" aria-current="page">Pakistan Income Tax Guide</span></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <article class="prose max-w-none">
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Pakistan Income Tax Guide: FBR Tax Slabs, Rates & Calculator</h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-body dark:text-muted">Last updated: August 2026 | Verified FBR Guidelines | 10 min read</p>

          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562564055-71e051d33c19?w=1200&q=80" alt="Pakistan income tax guide and FBR filing documents" class="mb-6 w-full rounded-lg object-cover max-h-80 sm:max-h-96" loading="lazy" />

          <!-- Early Calculator CTA -->
          <div class="my-6 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 dark:border-primary/20 dark:bg-primary/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Calculate Your Pakistan Income Tax</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted mt-1">Estimate FBR progressive tax slabs, monthly salary deductions, and take-home pay instantly.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/countries/pakistan/income-tax/income-tax-calculator" class="btn btn-primary text-sm font-semibold shrink-0 px-5 py-2.5">
              Launch Pakistan Tax Calculator →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>Pakistan's income tax system is administered by the <strong>Federal Board of Revenue (FBR)</strong> under the <em>Income Tax Ordinance, 2001</em>. Income tax applies to salaried individuals, sole proprietors, business entities, and freelancers across defined progressive tax slabs.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Understanding the Pakistan Tax Year</h2>
            <p>Pakistan follows a July-June tax year running from <strong>1 July to 30 June</strong>. Returns for salaried individuals must be filed by <strong>September 30</strong> via the <a href="https://iris.fbr.gov.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">FBR IRIS Portal</a>.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">FBR Tax Slabs for Salaried Individuals</h2>
            <p>The FBR applies progressive tax rate bands to salaried individuals. The tax-free threshold is set at <strong>PKR 600,000</strong> annually:</p>

            <div class="my-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
              <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
                <thead class="bg-canvas-soft border-b border-hairline dark:bg-surface/80 dark:border-overlay-lighter text-ink dark:text-on-primary font-bold">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="p-3">Annual Taxable Income (PKR)</th>
                    <th class="p-3">FBR Tax Rate</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline dark:divide-overlay-lighter">
                  <tr><td class="p-3">Up to PKR 600,000</td><td class="p-3 font-bold text-primary dark:text-on-primary">0% (Tax-Free)</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="p-3">PKR 600,001 – 1,200,000</td><td class="p-3">5% on excess over PKR 600,000</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="p-3">PKR 1,200,001 – 2,200,000</td><td class="p-3">PKR 30,000 + 15% on excess over PKR 1.2M</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="p-3">PKR 2,200,001 – 3,200,000</td><td class="p-3">PKR 180,000 + 25% on excess over PKR 2.2M</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="p-3">PKR 3,200,001 – 4,100,000</td><td class="p-3">PKR 430,000 + 30% on excess over PKR 3.2M</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="p-3">Above PKR 4,100,000</td><td class="p-3 font-bold text-primary dark:text-on-primary">PKR 700,000 + 35% on excess over PKR 4.1M</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Active Taxpayer List (ATL) Filer Advantage</h2>
            <p>Appearing on the FBR Active Taxpayer List (ATL) grants "filer status," which substantially lowers withholding tax rates on banking transactions, property sales, vehicle registrations, and dividend payouts compared to non-filers. Check our <a href="/blogs/pakistan-tax-filing-guide" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Pakistan Tax Filing Guide</a> for step-by-step return filing instructions.</p>

            {faqSchema.mainEntity.map(faq => (
              <div class="my-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">{faq.name}</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">{faq.acceptedAnswer.text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- Internal Resource Linking Grid -->
          <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline dark:border-overlay-lighter">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6 dark:text-on-primary">Pakistan Tax Tools & Related Guides</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
              <a href="/countries/pakistan/income-tax/income-tax-calculator" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Pakistan Income Tax Calculator</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Estimate FBR salary tax & monthly deductions.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/pakistan-salary-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Pakistan Salary Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Detailed guide to monthly salary tax deductions.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/pakistan-fbr-tax-slabs" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">FBR Tax Slabs Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Complete breakdown of FBR tax brackets.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/pakistan-vehicle-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Pakistan Vehicle Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Token tax rates across Punjab, Sindh, KPK & Islamabad.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/pakistan-property-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Pakistan Property Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Capital gains tax & provincial property charges.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/pakistan-sales-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Pakistan Sales Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Standard 18% sales tax & FBR Iris returns.</p>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Further Reading</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body dark:text-muted">
            <li><a href="https://www.fbr.gov.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Federal Board of Revenue (FBR) – Official Website</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taxation_in_Pakistan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Taxation in Pakistan – Wikipedia</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://iris.fbr.gov.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">FBR IRIS Portal – Income Tax Filing</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.fbr.gov.pk/forms-and-publications" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">FBR Forms and Publications Library</a></li>
          </ul>

        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>